        18 => "Infographic titled \"The Strategic Objectives Aim At\" showing six callout boxes arranged around a robot-and-tablet illustration, listing objectives: establishing a governance framework, fostering AI-driven public sector transformation, expanding AI literacy/skills, strengthening AI research/innovation ecosystems, promoting data interoperability while preserving privacy, and ensuring AI supports social inclusion, sustainability and competitiveness.",
        25 => "Diagram titled \"AIM in Context\" showing two arrows (Government Programme 2025-2029 and Blueprint 2025-2029) converging into \"AI FOR MAURITIUS (AIM)\", followed by a grid of the \"Six Core Dimensions\" with their strategic focus: Digital Infrastructure Maturity, Innovation Culture & Ecosystem, Workforce & Capacity Building, Regulatory Framework, Adoption - Private & Public Sector, and International Collaboration.",
        26 => "Infographic titled \"National Enablers for Responsible AI\" presenting six labeled description boxes (Digital Infrastructure Maturity, Innovation Culture and Ecosystem, Workforce and Capacity Building, Governance Framework, Adoption – Private and Public Sector, International Collaboration) arranged around a smart-city illustration.",
