        38 => "Three-panel diagram showing the AI4AI rollout phases: Phase 1 (establishing governance/ethics frameworks and training first educator cohorts), Phase 2 (scaling AI literacy across sectors and districts), and Phase 3 (consolidating and embedding AI literacy nationally).",
