        40 => "Detailed table \"No One Is Left Behind\" segmenting AI literacy audiences into nine groups (Pre-Primary, Primary, Secondary, TVET, Tertiary, SEN/Special Education Needs, Working Adults, Non-Working Adults, Policy-Makers and Leaders), each with its target group, awareness focus and expected outcome.",
        41 => "Diagram for \"Pillar 1: Introduction to AI,\" presenting the rationale, strategic objectives and expected outcomes for the foundational AI-awareness pillar of the AI4AI programme.",
        42 => "Diagram for \"Pillar 2: Prompt Engineering,\" presenting the rationale, strategic objectives and expected outcomes for teaching citizens to craft effective AI prompts.",
