        46 => "Semicircular gauge diagram labeled \"Evaluation Framework,\" accompanied by four boxes describing Formative Assessment, Practical Evaluation, Certification and Recognition, and Feedback and Continuous Improvement.",
        47 => "Icon list of six \"Proposed Delivery Channels\" for AI literacy: National Digital Learning Platform, Formal Education Pathways, Workplace and Professional Development, Community and Regional Outreach, Media and Public Awareness, and Public–Private–People Partnerships.",
        48 => "Page on \"Capacity Building\" with four boxes covering Workforce Skilling, Align Education with Industry Needs, Attract Global Expertise, and Structured Capacity Building Programmes.",
        52 => "Diagram \"AI Governance four main approaches\" showing Horizontal, Vertical, Decentralised and Principles-Based governance models arranged around a scales-of-justice icon.",
        53 => "Numbered, color-coded list of \"nine ethical pillars\" adopted by Mauritius for AI governance: Legality & Purpose-Limitation, Transparency & Explainability, Human Oversight & Accountability, Fairness & Non-Discrimination, Privacy & Data Minimisation, Security & Resilience, Auditability & Traceability, Inclusivity & Accessibility, and Public Engagement & Redress.",
        54 => "Table \"Policy Synergy and Strategic Alignment\" listing five domains (Cybersecurity, Data Protection, AI Governance, Skills & Culture, International Cooperation) with their lead authority, strategic action and review frequency.",
        57 => "Illustrated smart-city street scene with four use-case callout boxes: AI-Adjusted Traffic Signals, AI-Based Crime Pattern Analysis, AI Pattern Analysis for Financial Services, and AI-Driven Waste, Water, Air & Agriculture Management, each with citizen impact and opportunity notes.",
        58 => "Illustrated street scene with four more use-case callout boxes: AI Legal Assistants, AI-Based Personalised Learning & Skills Matching, AI-Powered E-Health, and Citizen Service Chatbot \"KOREK!\"/DIVA, each with citizen impact and opportunity notes.",
        60 => "Detailed table outlining Mauritius's international AI collaboration agenda across five focus areas (Citizen-Centric Services, Finance & Fintech, Smart Agriculture, AI Incubators & Start-ups, Global Tech Leadership), with collaboration objective, key enablers, challenges and proposed actions for each.",
        61 => "Diagram \"Key Initiatives\" for international partnerships, showing four labeled boxes (Strengthen Bilateral Cooperation, Engage in Global AI Ethics and Governance Platforms, Mauritius AI Fellowship Programme, Leverage Multilateral Funding and Technical Assistance) around a globe illustration.",
