    'fairguidelines' => [
        1 => "Cover page illustration on a dark navy background showing a diverse group of Mauritian people (a man in a wheelchair being assisted, an elderly man, a woman in a sari, a child, a man with a laptop, a person in a headscarf, and others) standing together, with a small avatar of a woman labelled 'DIVA (Digital Interactive Virtual Assistant) your AI Partner' above them. Surrounding icons include a heart with a medical cross, a banknote, scales of justice, a graduation cap, a traffic light, and a plant sprout, symbolising health, finance, justice, education, safety and growth. The government coat of arms appears at the top above the text 'Ministry of Information Technology, Communication and Innovation' and the title 'FAIR - Guidelines for the Development and Use of Artificial Intelligence'.",
        3 => "A hexagonal diagram divided into five coloured segments, each with an icon, representing the policy instruments supporting Mauritius's AI approach: a document icon (purple) for the National Artificial Intelligence Strategy setting long-term vision and priorities; a bar-chart icon (teal) for the FAIR Guidelines providing shared principles and practical considerations; an eye icon (yellow) for the AI Playbook giving operational guidance and tools; a handshake icon (pink/red) for sector-specific policies, guidelines and standards; and an hourglass icon (green) for laws and regulations that give legal effect over time. Callout boxes connected to each segment describe its role, and a note states these instruments work together without creating legal obligations.",
        5 => "A horizontal diagram of four connected colour-coded blocks spelling out the FAIR acronym: an orange-pink block with the letter F for Fairness, a purple-blue block with A for Accountability, a magenta block with I for Inclusiveness and Integrity, and a teal-green block with R for Responsibility, each topped with a circular badge containing its letter.",
        38 => "Back cover on a dark navy background. At the top is the 'AI UNIT' logo: three abstract human figures in pink, blue and yellow-green formed from circles and curved shapes, standing above a branching tree-like network of connected dots, next to a QR code. Below is an illustration of DIVA, a smiling animated female avatar with glasses and a blue collared top, encircled by a glowing pink ring with digital circuit-line graphics extending to the sides. Beneath her is the title 'FAIR - Guidelines for the Development and Use of Artificial Intelligence' and the credit 'Ministry of Information Technology, Communication and Innovation'.",
    ],
